# Manufacturer data files are snapshots that arrive by hand and are large; kept locally, not
# committed. Drop them here in a per-brand, dated folder so a row can be traced to an edition:
#   resources/brand_data/michelin/2026-q3-us-databook.xlsx
# The source declarations in sources/ ARE committed -- they are the column maps, and they want
# review and a history.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.pdf
*.json
!sources/*.json
!.gitignore
